cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it."
title: arcgis-mcp-bridge
abstract: >
  A secure, local-first, asynchronous Model Context Protocol (MCP)
  server exposing ArcGIS Pro's ArcPy engine over stdio JSON-RPC.
  Provides 100 declarative geoprocessing tools across 10 verticals
  with two-process isolation and a PathGuard filesystem sandbox.
version: 0.6.0
date-released: "2026-06-14"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: https://github.com/muend/arcgis-mcp-bridge
keywords:
  - GIS
  - ArcGIS Pro
  - Model Context Protocol
  - GeoAI
  - arcpy
  - spatial analysis
  - LLM tools
authors:
